;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All C(H,H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All C(H,H,H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 C4-C3 = C5-C4 = C6-C5 = C7-C6 = C8-C7 = C8-C3
 1.39 with sigma of 0.01
 N2-C9 \\sim N2A-C9A \\sim N2B-C9B \\sim N2C-C9C
 with sigma of 0.02
3. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uanis(N2) = Uanis(C9) = Uanis(N2A) = Uanis(C9A) = Uanis(N2C) = Uanis(C9C) =
Uanis(N2B) = Uanis(C9B)
